{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>For [all tables are full of vomit, filth] etc.</b> Such is the way of the drunkards." "<b>Without [lit. no] place.</b> That it is not full, like עד אפס מקום (Isaiah 5:8). So too מלאו קיא ומלאו צואה, and behold from above and from below."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:31.407803859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}